# Implementation plan — Spec 1.6.0

## Summary

Spec 1.6.0 adds a **Company microservice** (`company/`) for company registration, membership roles, and super-admin approval. **WebOnOne v2** gets **Basic Settings** (`/settings/basic`) with register-company dialog (name + Media logo upload), company status display, and a super-admin pending-approval UI. See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-company-service.md](./02-company-service.md), [03-webonone-company-ui.md](./03-webonone-company-ui.md), [04-super-admin-approval.md](./04-super-admin-approval.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.6.0` |
| Package builds | `npm run build:media-embed` before webonone prod build |
| Migrations | `company/migrations` — companies, memberships, super_admins |
| Env | `company/backend/.env.example`; `webonone-v2/backend/.env.example` — `COMPANY_API_BASE_URL`; `webonone-v2/frontend/.env.example` — `VITE_MEDIA_ORIGIN` |
| JWT | `JWT_SECRET` duplicated in Company + WebOnOne backends (same as Identity) |

