## Phase 1 — Company service scaffold

**Goal:** Standalone `company/` with DB, health, JWT verify, super-admin seed.

**Exit criteria:** `npm run dev:company` starts; `GET /health` 200; super-admin seed login works.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Scaffold service root | `company/package.json`, workspaces |
| Backend Express app | `company/backend/src/` |
| Migrations | `company/migrations/` — `companies`, `company_memberships`, `super_admins` |
| Super-admin seed | `company/backend/src/db/seeds/` or migration |
| `GET /health` | `company/backend/src/routes/health.ts` |
| `requireIdentityJwt` | `company/backend/src/middleware/requireIdentityJwt.ts` |
| `POST /auth/super-admin/login` | `company/backend/src/routes/auth.ts` |
| Root wiring | Root `package.json` — `dev:company`, workspace |

**Verify:** `curl http://localhost:4004/health`; super-admin login returns token

